{
  "datasets": [
    {
      "displayName": "by kind",
      "name": "des_data_expectations__by_kind",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `kind`, MEASURE(`steps`) AS `steps`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_steps`\n",
        "WHERE `owner` = 'des'\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`, `kind`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`, `kind`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "not passed daily",
      "name": "des_data_expectations__not_passed_daily",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `severity`, MEASURE(`steps`) AS `steps`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_steps`\n",
        "WHERE `owner` = 'des' AND `passed` = FALSE\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`, `severity`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`, `severity`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "results",
      "name": "des_data_expectations__results",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `dataset`, `kind`, `step`, `severity`, `count`, `message`, `run_id`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_steps`\n",
        "WHERE `owner` = 'des'\n",
        "ORDER BY `day` DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "failed",
      "name": "des_data_expectations__failed",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `dataset`, `kind`, `step`, `severity`, `message`, `run_id`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_steps`\n",
        "WHERE `owner` = 'des' AND `passed` = FALSE\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "restated",
      "name": "des_data_expectations__restated",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `table`, `window`, `reason`, `measure`, `before`, `after`, `change`, `run_id`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_restatements`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day` DESC"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "displayName": "Data expectations",
      "layout": [
        {
          "position": {
            "height": 2,
            "width": 6,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "widget": {
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Data expectations\n",
                "\n",
                "Is the data right? Quality rules, reconciliation between hops and profiles, each with its severity, owned by the data expectation services. W1e fills in the detail (failed rows, the hop and keys of a reconciliation entry, quarantine and release).\n",
                "\n",
                "Owned by data expectation services. Built from the ops metric views over the compact ops tables (run log, daily telemetry copy, freshness, alerts), joined by run id. Discharges DPC-0057, DQ-04, REC-01, SEV-01, RSTM-01."
              ]
            },
            "name": "about"
          }
        },
        {
